dog standard Fantasy Points line is captured from every committed board copy with the copy's own timestamps (the hook commits about every 30 minutes); NBA.com's lineup status for the player is stamped on live captures.","Priced feature = PrizePicks Fantasy Score line as of the slate's MORNING pull (the last copy inside 10:00-17:00Z on the slate date, median lead about 9 h) minus the UD line at its first capture on or after that pull. The PP pre-tip line is a secondary column, never priced. No PP pair = gap 0, flagged.","P = 0.5 + 0.034 x (gap - offset), offset = mean gap over prior slates only, clipped to [0.05, 0.95]; the engine deviation (FP v2 mean - UD line) and the matchup column are logged at zero weight and never priced.","Gate: n = 750 graded clock lines, paired gain vs flat 0.5 >= +0.003 nats with the two-way (player + date) clustered CI excluding 0, and the one-sided calibration prong; futility stop at 375 if the point estimate is <= 0. Not shown at 750 = FAIL."]}